sequenceDiagram
    actor Supervisor
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant PIPE as Pipeline Orchestrator
    participant ENG as Analytics Engines x5
    participant LLM as LLM Client
    participant DB as DuckDB

    Supervisor->>FE: Upload CSE telemetry file
    FE->>API: POST /api/ingest/{cse_id}/{data_type}
    API->>PIPE: run_pipeline(content, format, cse_id)
    PIPE->>DB: validate -> clean -> normalize -> store
    DB-->>PIPE: batch_id, row counts
    PIPE-->>API: {rows_accepted, rows_rejected, batch_id}
    API-->>FE: Ingest result

    Supervisor->>FE: Click "Run Analytics"
    FE->>API: POST /api/analytics/run
    loop Each of 5 engines
        API->>ENG: engine.run(con, cse_id)
        ENG->>DB: SELECT alerts/cases/assets
        DB-->>ENG: rows
        ENG-->>API: List[Finding]
    end
    API->>DB: persist_findings() DELETE+INSERT
    API->>DB: update_risk_scores() INSERT OR REPLACE
    API-->>FE: {total_findings, by_engine, risk_scores}

    Supervisor->>FE: Open Attack Path page
    FE->>API: POST /api/traceback/run {cse_id}
    API->>DB: fetch alerts for CSE
    API->>LLM: generate(evidence_prompt + reviews_context)
    LLM-->>API: JSON narrative + stages
    API->>DB: verify evidence_ids against alerts table
    API->>DB: INSERT traceback_reports
    API-->>FE: TracebackReport {stages, graph, narrative}
    FE->>FE: Render React Flow graph

    Supervisor->>FE: Submit review decision
    FE->>API: POST /api/reviews/ {finding_id, decision, notes}
    API->>DB: INSERT reviews
    alt decision == FALSE_POSITIVE
        API->>DB: INSERT feedback_logs (PENDING)
    end
    API->>DB: INSERT audit_logs
    API-->>FE: {review_id, feedback_log_id}

    Supervisor->>FE: Approve tuning proposal
    FE->>API: POST /api/feedback/approve/{log_id}
    API->>DB: UPDATE feedback_logs SET status=APPROVED
    API->>DB: INSERT audit_logs APPROVE_RULE_TUNING
    API-->>FE: success
